{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>你是否經常覺得難以養成新習慣，又或者在專注工作時不斷分心？FocusHabit Pro 是一款結合習慣追蹤與番茄鐘計時器的生產力應用，適合任何想建立穩定日常節奏、提升專注力的人。目前這款 App 正在限時免費，原價 US $2.99，現在即可零成本下載。</p>\n\n<h2>核心功能介紹</h2>\n<p>FocusHabit Pro 提供直觀的習慣追蹤系統，只需簡單點擊即可記錄每日或每週習慣，並透過視覺化的連續記錄日曆、每週完成統計與 90 天熱力圖，讓你一眼看清自己的進步。番茄鐘專注計時支援 25/5 分鐘模式與自訂時長，還內建雨聲、海浪、森林、白噪音等環境音效，幫助你更快進入心流狀態。此外，背景音效與 Apple Watch 支援讓你即使在螢幕關閉時也能持續追蹤。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1284x2778bb-209-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1284x2778bb-210-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1284x2778bb-211-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1284x2778bb-212-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1284x2778bb-213-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1284x2778bb-214-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：FocusHabit Pro</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-30T19:19:32.136095+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":373,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}